# ---- Script output written to the repo root ----
# Anchored with a leading / so assets inside week folders can still be committed.
# SQLite databases from the airline assistant, images from the diffusers demos,
# audio from the text-to-speech demos.
/*.db
/*.db-journal
/*.sqlite3
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.wav
/*.mp3

# week3/mom_from_audiofile.py: the 14 MB course recording (re-downloadable from the
# link in the script) and what it derives from it.
/week3/denver_extract.mp3
/week3/denver_extract_transcript.txt
/week3/denver_extract_minutes.md

# ---- Logs & local scratch output ----
*.log
report.txt
